anscriptional regulation of selected genes expression through chromatin remodeling (PubMed:16634648, PubMed:17617668). Acts as a coactivator for CREB-mediated transcription, steroid receptor-mediated transcription, and Notch-mediated transcription (PubMed:10347196, PubMed:11522779, PubMed:14500758, PubMed:16024792)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}